{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">政府因應日前懷疑有狗咬死人事件再派人到現場，並捕捉到兩隻無人看管唐狗。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG.CATCH-0030_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vhwTN15x2t1790115004.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DOG.CATCH-0030_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方、漁護署及政府化驗所人員晚上約7時，到達元朗壆圍南路一帶，即場商議行動細節。有漁護署人員帶同捕犬桿，以及狗籠到場。今次已是連續第三次的同類行動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG.CATCH-0030_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ywfsItrdYt1790114969.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DOG.CATCH-0030_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">行動期間共捕捉兩隻無人看管的唐狗，並送到動物管理中心扣留調查及觀察。如發現狗隻植有晶片，署方會聯繫狗主協助調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">對於周一捕獲的兩隻已植入晶片的狗，署方稱仍在聯絡其狗主。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T22:38:20.616711+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}